.TH KALICLEAN 1 "November 2026" "kaliclean 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kaliclean \- frosted-glass system hygiene utility for Kali Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kaliclean
.RI [ Qt-options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B KaliClean
is a desktop utility that reclaims memory and disk space on Kali Linux.
It presents ten cleanup targets (kernel caches, swap, journals, apt
archives, temporary files, thumbnails, browser caches, trash, crash
reports and the DNS resolver cache), live RAM/swap/disk gauges, a progress
ring and an activity log.
.PP
When elevated tasks are selected, the application asks for the login
password in its own dialog. The password is held only in process memory,
is never written to disk, and is discarded when the application exits.
.SH USAGE
Select the desired cleanup targets and press
.B Clean & refresh\fR.
Targets that are off by default (Trash, DNS resolver cache) are irreversible
or briefly interrupt the network, so enable them deliberately.
.SH OPTIONS
Any arguments are passed through to the Python interpreter hosting the Qt
application; standard Qt options such as
.B \-\-style
or
.B \-\-platform
may be used.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/kaliclean/
Application code and resources.
.TP
.I /usr/bin/kaliclean
Command-line launcher.
.TP
.I /usr/share/applications/kaliclean.desktop
Desktop menu entry.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR apt-get (8),
.BR journalctl (1),
.BR swapoff (8)
